042700 E000-Process-Multiple-Occ.                                       04270073
042800*                                                                 04280073
042900* More than one occurence for one and the same charge type means  04290073
043000* that the default charge is computed from a variable percentage. 04300073
043100*                                                                 04310073
043200     Set   R349IPP0-In-Get-Next    To    True                     04320073
043300*                                                                 04330073
043400*    Feilretting                                                  04340073
043500     Initialize                          R116L030-Currency-Xchange04350073
043600     Set   R116L030-Version        To    True                     04360073
043700     Move  R115ISC0-Fin-Inst-No(1:4)                              04370073
043800                                   To    R116L030-In-Fin-Inst-No  04380073
043900     Move  Ws-PA-or-CA-Amount      To    R116L030-In-From-Amount  04390073
044000     Move  R115ICA0-Currency       To    R116L030-In-From-Currency04400073
044100     Set   R116L030-In-To-Basic-Cur                               04410073
044200                                   To    True                     04420073
044300     Perform L130-Call-LMOD-VA                                    04430073
044400     Move  R116L030-To-Amount      To    WS-PA-or-CA-Amount-Ex    04440073
044500*    Feilretting slutt                                            04450073
044510*                                                                 04451073
044520     Perform until R7919999-Return-Error                          04452073
044530     or   WS-PA-or-CA-Amount-Ex     <=   WS-Stored-Gyldig-Til-Bel 04453073
044540*      -----------------------------------------------------------04454073
044550       If R349IPP0-Gyldig-Til-Belop <    WS-PA-or-CA-Amount-Ex    04455073
044560         Compute                         WS-Difference            04456073
044570             =                           R349IPP0-Gyldig-Til-Belop04457073
044580             -                           WS-Stored-Gyldig-Til-Bel 04458073
044590         End-Compute                                              04459073
044600*                                                                 04460073
044700       Else                                                       04470073
044800         Compute                         WS-Difference            04480073
044900             =                           WS-PA-or-CA-Amount-Ex    04490073
045000             -                           WS-Stored-Gyldig-Til-Bel 04500073
045100         End-Compute                                              04510073
045200*                                                                 04520073
045300       End-If                                                     04530073
045400*      -----------------------------------------------------------04540073
045500       Compute                           WS-Increment             04550073
045600           =                             WS-Difference            04560073
045700           *                             R349IPP0-Prisprosent     04570073
045800           /                             100                      04580073
045900       End-Compute                                                04590073
046000*      -----------------------------------------------------------04600073
046100       Add   WS-Increment          To    WS-POP-Charge-Amount     04610073
046200*      -----------------------------------------------------------04620073
046300       Move  R349IPP0-Gyldig-Til-Belop                            04630073
046400                                   To    WS-Stored-Gyldig-Til-Bel 04640073
046500       Perform C430-Call-DBI-PP-PP                                04650073
046600*      -----------------------------------------------------------04660073
046700     End-Perform                                                  04670073
046800*                                                                 04680073
046900     Set   R7919999-Return-OK      To    True                     04690073
047000*                                                                 04700073
