050000     Move  R115ICA0-Currency       To    R116L030-In-To-Currency  05000073
050100     Move  R115ISC0-Fin-Inst-No(1:4)                              05010073
050200                                   To    R116L030-In-Fin-Inst-No  05020073
050300*                                                                 05030073
050400     If  WS-POP-Charge-Amount      not = +0                       05040073
050500         Move  WS-POP-Charge-Amount                               05050073
050600                                   To    R116L030-In-From-Amount  05060073
050700         Perform L130-Call-LMOD-VA                                05070073
