052900       Perform L130-Call-LMOD-VA                                  05290073
053000       Move  R116L030-To-Amount    To    WS-Min-Charge            05300073
053100     Else                                                         05310073
053200       Move  WS-POP-Min-Charge     To    WS-Min-Charge            05320073
